# ACCEPTANCE: cu-006

T006.1 A CU whose attributed set hits its own no-touch list fails with rule no-touch and the path is printed and written to boundary-breaches.txt.
T006.2 Two CUs that write the same path in one wave both fail with rule shared-write.
T006.3 An unattributed change that hits any no-touch list in the wave fails the wave with rule unattributed and names the guarded CUs.
T006.4 A CU whose no-touch list yields no enforceable pattern fails with rule unenforceable.
T006.5 A flat frame file is gated exactly like a per-CU folder.
T006.6 A sibling CU's write never appears in another CU's files_changed.
T006.7 The runner exits 1 when the final status is not CONVERGED.
